{"version":1,"key":"card:584","content":{"id":584,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"885d17be-be8f-476b-966e-7fc6a67751c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 的优势及特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4fdb21db-d805-4b05-b87b-31ab15381eb8","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d4bf01cc-3389-4fc7-a151-b2b0cdcfebba","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c449e326-ce3b-4d9e-9238-df9451350830","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"节省存储空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61317600-2f20-4899-ad17-b3d44a582992","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在一台电脑上有 100 个 npm 项目，每个项目中存在相同的依赖，那么这些依赖在每个项目中都会存在一份。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cc08a2d-0275-4269-8394-df33144d5198","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 有一个中心化的 content-addressed store 来解决这个问题，所有的依赖都会安装到这里，在两个方面做了优化来节省磁盘空间："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e12cd54a-04c0-4c5d-87cc-f62c3efb68eb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"267186ec-6e93-4a4a-96d3-f4eb430b3b3c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c772bc8-0806-424f-80f1-6039b66e04b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于相同依赖的不同版本，只会存储发生变化的版本，比如两个版本间只存在一个文件的变化，那么安装新版本时，只会添加一个变化的文件，而不是下载整个新的包"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9422e860-324c-4ad6-9e2b-e6137ca81b1b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2df32b2-1a31-45e4-9618-94b2554dc6ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有的数据仅保存在中心化的 content-addressed store 中，项目中的包通过硬链接技术链接到 store 中的文件，不管有多少个项目，相同的依赖仅存在一份，做到了项目间的依赖共享"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"73f2d346-24d6-47b5-aef0-4f796b5fe844","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a72e660-bc87-4b4b-b75b-741be087a1fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装速度"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e24d44e1-6bec-4c9b-976a-d8cdc79d2aa6.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e24d44e1-6bec-4c9b-976a-d8cdc79d2aa6.png","width":714,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"35cf618e-8f78-49ce-b718-e432eb5c5dd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"53302a05-c947-4816-9c6b-7adb323bb85f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 的安装分为三个阶段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b051b20f-6677-4d8f-8631-348042bc30a9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e232251a-244c-4a1a-bacd-fe12e9295f31","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e58185a0-75cc-4de9-872b-07a11c94d7fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"依赖解析"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9bba7692-48af-4776-a8e4-59c299ced3fd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f9e88a2e-84cc-40ac-b504-2afa6853f0b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules 目录结构计算"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a945f57b-c34d-41c4-a6d9-e8dde53ef1b3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9cdde0a-e119-4bfd-8433-1739b2ec3361","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"链接依赖"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_49ef845f-921f-42a2-8eb0-fe97c4b54aaf.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_49ef845f-921f-42a2-8eb0-fe97c4b54aaf.png","width":714,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"ca6a2891-a842-495c-96fa-a6b4fdafb5d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9bfa2e7d-c641-412a-85a3-cfd1928f7297","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于传统的三阶段：解析依赖、安装依赖、将所有依赖写入到 node_modules 中要快很多"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3d95be92-d327-4fb3-bb98-4d79a59f85a7.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3d95be92-d327-4fb3-bb98-4d79a59f85a7.png","width":714,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"d708b556-81c3-48bc-9a7b-43c686e4b83f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6b081b2b-87ab-46d0-99c8-334e988ec6bc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db1d9aec-3b86-4537-9552-001bb9f0c1bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"幽灵依赖"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac791a07-7250-4bd4-a11f-9f4f5d845624","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之前为了解决安装路径过长的问题，npm 会将依赖平铺安装在 node_modules 下面，但是这会带来幽灵依赖的问题，即可以使用未在 package.json 中声明的包。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4acf5fc9-b1b4-4c63-ba4d-b5bfc5ff7ad2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 会把所有的依赖都平铺安装到 node_modules/.pnpm 下面，package.json 中显式声明的依赖会通过软链提升到 node_modules 下面，由于只有 package.json 中显式声明的依赖直接放到了 node_modules 下面，因此解决了幽灵依赖问题，同时因为依赖平铺安装在 .pnpm 目录下，因此也解决了路径过长的问题。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"892e050a-f5e0-482a-8489-dc9c7f0a6b7e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"539e94f5-2426-40bd-b669-9155967a3d88","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"903da508-7f8b-45d6-8296-ecba196d0d1f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e57ae0d2-1208-455a-a1c1-249568cf4d85","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://www.pnpm.cn/benchmarks","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16